// COLISEUM has no story: New Game and every chapter switch go straight to the battle map.
// Vanilla gProcScr_GameControl runs, before each chapter:
//   0x085918AC  PROC_CALL(GameCtrlStartIntroMonologue)          // the "continent of Magvel" intro
//   0x085918BC  PROC_START_CHILD_BLOCKING(ProcScr_WorldMapWrapper)
// Both become PROC_CALL(Col_NoStory) (src/core/battle.c). EndWM, which runs next, is safe without a world
// map (it ends procs that don't exist and resets the backgrounds).

// Autosave (spec 76, Phase 10): after the chapter switch vanilla opens its save menu
//   0x08591924  PROC_CALL(GameControl_CallPostChapterSaveMenu)
// which becomes PROC_CALL(Col_AutoSave) (src/core/reward.c): the run is saved to its slot.

PUSH
ORG 0x591924
SHORT 2 0; POIN Col_AutoSave|1
ORG 0x5918AC
SHORT 2 0; POIN Col_NoStory|1
ORG 0x5918BC
SHORT 2 0; POIN Col_NoStory|1
POP
